  "topography": {
    "project_purpose": "Velodrome is a decentralized AMM and liquidity hub for the Optimism/Superchain ecosystem, with current deployments beyond only Optimism and Celo. It facilitates token swaps and liquidity provision and uses a ve(3,3) model in which VELO holders can lock tokens to vote on gauge emissions and earn trading fees.",
